{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":500750,"name":"Marco","username":"marcoth0908","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/41988e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-25T05:04:00.974Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHello guys. I have been created a plan on “project”, the model for the project is opus 5.5.\u003cbr\u003e\nBut even if I choose to build the plan with grok 4.7, it still spawning sub-agent in the project with opus 5.5 instead of the selected model. It burns out tons of my token for 3rd party model. I am not sure if this is an issue to be fixed or not. Thanks for helping\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/7/5725c97b0e30e9368dea15233f10eedc35796c24.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/cqWuTn5Pa4FrBL7E9pXMuLg5U3i.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/7/5725c97b0e30e9368dea15233f10eedc35796c24.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cqWuTn5Pa4FrBL7E9pXMuLg5U3i\" width=\"690\" height=\"85\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1B1A\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1022×127 5.53 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/9/f9762c2f1bfd2ec8b4225231e9befc2444dadcbc.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/zAQ4zwdKQLzWkYvWVwfzLxHPMQI.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/9/f9762c2f1bfd2ec8b4225231e9befc2444dadcbc_2_261x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zAQ4zwdKQLzWkYvWVwfzLxHPMQI\" width=\"261\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/9/f9762c2f1bfd2ec8b4225231e9befc2444dadcbc_2_261x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/9/f9762c2f1bfd2ec8b4225231e9befc2444dadcbc_2_391x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/9/f9762c2f1bfd2ec8b4225231e9befc2444dadcbc_2_522x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1D1D1D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e535×1024 34.3 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-25T05:04:06.467Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":30.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":172959,"topic_slug":"mismatch-on-sub-agent-model-for-execute-plan","display_username":"Marco","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139717,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/mismatch-on-sub-agent-model-for-execute-plan/172959/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":501940,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T07:55:28.706Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the report. You’re right, this shouldn’t happen, and it’s not something in your setup.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRight now, in a Project, a scheduled Build uses the Project’s main chat model, and any agents it spawns inherit that model. That’s why you saw Opus 5.5 instead of the Grok 4.7 you selected. I passed this to the team, and it’s a known issue we’re tracking.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUntil it’s fixed, here’s how to get a build on Grok 4.7:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the Project’s main chat Weather Board.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn the model picker at the bottom of that chat, select Grok 4.7 Extra High.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the plan and click Build.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the new agent that starts, then check its model picker. It should show Grok 4.7.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAfter that, you can switch the Project’s main chat back to Opus 5.5 if you want Opus for planning.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf the agent is already running on Opus, switch its own model picker to Grok 4.7, and it’ll apply to the next message.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn token usage for the selected model, if you want the team to look at your specific usage, email \u003ca href=\"mailto:hi@cursor.com\"\u003ehi@cursor.com\u003c/a\u003e. A separate team handles that.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if the workaround worked.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"post